# Testing conventions

## Unit / API (Vitest)

- Config: `@vitest.config.ts`
- API integration tests: `src/api/__tests__/`
- Shared mocks: `@src/api/__tests__/helpers.ts` (`mockAuthForRole`, `setupTestMocks`, `createMockDb`, …)
- Factories: `@src/test/factories.ts`
- Mock Clerk + DB; do not hit real Postgres/Clerk in unit tests.

## Coverage gates

- `pnpm run test:coverage`
- `pnpm run check:api-coverage` — API route files must stay ≥80% statements (CI enforced).

## E2E (Playwright)

- Specs: `e2e/`
- Config loads `.env` / `.env.local`; Clerk signed-in flows need secrets documented in `@docs/e2e-clerk.md`.
- Prefer stable smoke/auth-redirect coverage; update visual snapshots only intentionally (`--update-snapshots`).

## When changing behavior

- Update or add tests next to the change.
- Prefer extending existing API test files over creating one-off unmaintainable suites.
